The '''Vinyl Sack''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sack]] that stores {{Green|20,160}} of [[Pest Vinyls]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Vinyl Sack''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Pesthunter Phillip}} for {{Pests|100}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Vinyl Sack''' can store [[Pest Vinyls]].
